<p>President Trump said the United States could use the U.S. Navy to escort oil and gas tankers through the Strait of Hormuz, and that the U.S. International Development Finance Corporation would offer insurance to support shipping. His comments come as fighting involving Iran and Israel has increased risks in a waterway that carries a large share of global energy shipments, heightening worries about supply disruptions and higher prices.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/RJA02e9F8EPJX7HU4EYEhgKf3R2SMrPpyIN7G3A_ILIW40109U_NAssKNYmeQKmxTBPSZOSduttJ9JgdP_T66PMxprZVphYk1yW8iPdXWUGc1v-TCuyi9_oTaZEYpwzuLN3nj3DdGHHMH6uAk_rk9Hk6Kx6Bwh02aV-y5mkfSICFdM0OOIdkNyegeceN_S1fxxuimfHe1023EGlhoxq_123rmxA' alt='President Trump said the U.S. Navy was prepared to escort tankers through the Strait of Hormuz; oil prices fell slightly afterward.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Insurance pricing: Trump said the U.S. International Development Finance Corporation would offer ship insurance at a “very reasonable price” to help keep energy flowing.</li><li>Timing and platform: In a post on Truth Social, Trump said the U.S. Navy would begin escorting tankers through the Strait of Hormuz “as soon as possible” if necessary.</li><li>Policy framing: One report called the move one of Washington’s most aggressive steps yet to contain rising energy prices.</li><li>Market signal: Oil prices dipped slightly after Trump raised the possibility of U.S. Navy escorts.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>President Trump: In a Truth Social post, he said that if necessary the U.S. Navy would begin escorting tankers through the Strait of Hormuz “as soon as possible”. (<a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/trump-says-us-navy-could-escort-tankers-through-the-strait-of-hormuz/article70701140.ece'>The Hindu</a>)</li><li>Shipping industry (as described): Some shipping companies have held back from routing oil and gas through the strait because they fear attacks on their vessels. (<a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/03/03/world/middleeast/trump-tankers-hormuz.html'>The New York Times</a>)</li><li>Al Jazeera reporting: It framed Trump’s announcement around Iranian attacks in the Gulf and highlighted the U.S. plan to provide insurance support for ships. (<a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/3/3/us-will-provide-insurance-for-ships-in-gulf-amid-iranian-attacks-trump'>Al Jazeera</a>)</li><li>World Socialist Web Site analysis: It argued the escort pledge would escalate the conflict by moving U.S. warships closer to Iran as the U.S.-Israeli bombing campaign entered its fourth day. (<a href='https://www.wsws.org/en/articles/2026/03/04/vnrv-m04.html'>World Socialist Web Site</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.ndtv.com/world-news/israel-us-iran-war-trump-says-us-will-escort-insure-oil-tankers-amid-iran-war-11166225#publisher=newsstand'>Trump Says US Will Escort, Insure Oil Tankers Amid Iran War</a> - ndtv.com</li><li><a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/03/03/world/middleeast/trump-tankers-hormuz.html'>Trump Says U.S. Navy Might Escort Oil and Gas Tankers in Persian Gulf</a> - nytimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/3/3/us-will-provide-insurance-for-ships-in-gulf-amid-iranian-attacks-trump'>US will provide insurance for ships in Gulf amid Iranian attacks: Trump</a> - aljazeera.com</li><li><a href='https://www.wsws.org/en/articles/2026/03/04/vnrv-m04.html'>Trump says US Navy will escort ships through Strait of Hormuz as Iran war spirals</a> - wsws.org</li><li><a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/trump-says-us-navy-could-escort-tankers-through-the-strait-of-hormuz/article70701140.ece'>Trump says U.S. Navy could escort tankers through the Strait of Hormuz</a> - thehindu.com</li><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/united-states/trump-orders-oil-tanker-insurance-support-says-navy-could-escort-ships-in-gulf'>Trump orders oil tanker insurance support, says Navy could escort ships i